It may be. Do make the check I mentioned on a smaller model to see how many threads it actually uses (n threads does not automatically lead to n fully used cores).

> The model is a space-time, "semi-continuous" (gamma, binomial) model of animal density with one environmental covariate (modelled as "rw2").
